    "annotations": {
      "muster/openapi-method": "POST",
      "muster/openapi-path": "/v1/bridge/crier/webhook"
    },
    "description": "generic-custom Crier webhook carrier only; HMAC-SHA256 over raw HTTP body, constant-time compare and configured per-peer secret. Also authenticate bearer token and source map; sender/header is not authority. Derive request_id from stable delivery identity, not retry count. Batch validates all items first; durable per-item commits may survive a later 503; retry dedupes each item. configure never alters grants. Bearer+HMAC are REQUIRED BY THIS CHD PROFILE, optional in native Crier: configure CR_WEBHOOK_SECRET and per-agent bearer auth. Control kinds configure/configure_ack/probe are rejected 400 without business effects; bridge accepts message/reply/batch only. Extra native metadata is inert. HTTP 2xx is a transport ACK only; parse and persist CHD ack body separately.",
